// The signal is in the LogonType, not the raw 4624 count.
// A machine nobody logged into still emits 4624s - as LogonType 5 (service, SYSTEM).
// Human-relevant types: 2 (interactive), 3 (network), 10 (RemoteInteractive/RDP-Bastion).
// Type 5 is service noise; counting 4624 without splitting on LogonType misleads.
SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| where EventID == 4624
| summarize count() by LogonType
| order by LogonType asc
